{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "b30d5d0dc479fe035b845485dc5fc08019ee1242e26d60c1beaa15821d1c8ea5", "ja": "小悪魔の目覚め♡", "zh": "小恶魔的觉醒♡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f047cb3131b1dbfc2f66ca310f18a1ec0c4faeb15a3d28d889374933a1f32d02", "ja": "雪歩と美希のグラビア撮影の日。小悪魔ぶり\nを発揮する美希に、ますます自信をなくす雪\n歩。だが美希達に、雪歩らしくすればいいと\n教えられ、頑張ることに。こっそり見に来た\n伊織と真も見守る中、撮影を成功させた。", "zh": "雪步和美希拍摄写真照当天，看见美希充分\n展现出小恶魔的姿态后，雪步更加没自信。\n不过美希他们告诉雪步只要做自己就好，\n于是雪步决定努力看看。在两人以及偷偷\n跑来看的伊织与真守望下，拍摄顺利结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7a7981b344aa8665504661053fa27edbc660d70a3119c09925f36e8677cd05f0", "ja": "（真と伊織の撮影は、その後無事に終わった。\n今日は、雪歩と美希の撮影日だが……）", "zh": "（在那之后，真和伊织的拍摄顺利结束了。\n今天轮到雪步和美希进行拍摄……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d3b10e952b3975c7a80991596588115500cb43a32c7138b8a4fabe526c4f30a0", "ja": "{$P$}。\n真ちゃんと伊織ちゃんからメールが来ましたぁ。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n小真和伊织传简讯来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bd5ccb48d9592e481c71b6233df2fd07a4e3b5877ff7a4f9a342d649db05dfcd", "ja": "メールが？　二人ともダンスレッスン中のはずなのに、\nしょうがないな……。それで、なんだって？", "zh": "简讯？她们不是应该在进行舞蹈训练吗？\n真是的……所以，她们说了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2409a33ef497446c2ad1a415294e6fc3cd4f320158f93dd5c7e10b3706de9f09", "ja": "えっと……ぐっ！　って。", "zh": "那个……她们传了「握拳！」给我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "017e9ae9f0c0cfc1cc9d0fbbb738d344c2fcfd7edb4471a737d8dc4ea4e7137c", "ja": "……なるほど、ガッツポーズの絵文字か。\nそれで、その応援には応えられそうか？", "zh": "……喔，握拳打气的表情图示啊。\n那么，你能回应她们的期待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "baa603b8cda2d3ab6aeae1c2d1e6c0867988f0bfaaa6a462de42cfebc3984628", "ja": "は、はい、私なりに撮ってもらえるとは思いますぅ。\nでも、やっぱり自信は、ぜんぜん出てこなくて……。", "zh": "可、可以，我会尽最大的努力完成拍摄。\n不过，我还是一点自信也没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a4604894f184f0536f0954b1de6d233505de969b347131ef11170973c4f0403a", "ja": "じゃあ、先に始まる美希の撮影を見学しようか。参考に\nなるだろうし、心の準備もできるかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "美希会先拍，你就观摩一下她的拍摄情况吧。\n除了能当作参考外，或许也能让你做好心理准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "85139a11f190bb858da7df3775929a07dda3af902b4224857b05146efef0a9b7", "ja": "あ、はいっ。美希ちゃんの撮影、\n私も楽しみにしてたんです。……えへへっ。", "zh": "啊，好的。\n我也非常期待美希的拍摄……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1009_camman", "source_sha256": "661a472dd053670debcf59edf537d0df70d4229c9f6a6be23b76b6175ea92b88", "ja": "パシャパシャ！　パシャパシャパシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓！喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "dd5989b1b1dc6d591f395e973e212a7811493ecd310cf4a6c632eed138c71e2a", "ja": "ミキのこと、もっと見てみたい？　あはっ、いいよ？\nミキのここも、ここも、ぜんぶ……ハニーにあげる♪", "zh": "想再多看美希一会儿吗？啊哈，没问题喔。\n美希的这里，还有这里……全都让HONEY看个够♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1011_camman", "source_sha256": "68c2163f4f7a9c20e10bcb3e9ffc1edf0667267150f4b3bd842fc643f9ea86c2", "ja": "パシャパシャパシャパシャパシャパシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1012_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "e3587d7d75715c5d5e7ae24f566766b15496c9fba04b394d148f3fd67b927c2e", "ja": "ざわざわざわざわざわざわ……", "zh": "（一片哗然……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8f38ea122ca4f95b928c63fb818f7780158bf7abe14358205ac68243586d5f06", "ja": "（磨きのかかった小悪魔ぶりに、スタジオも騒然として\n……って美希、いよいよ小悪魔を通り越してないか？）", "zh": "（更上一层楼的小恶魔姿态引起摄影棚一阵骚动……\n话说，美希这样已经要超出小恶魔的领域了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "352ec124486019bdb7142e12e02fb88604bb21d0203f3370ddc566731a5c67c0", "ja": "美希ちゃん、セクシーで、とってもかわいくて……。\nやっぱり……すごい……！", "zh": "美希的表现很性感，而且非常可爱……\n她果然……非常厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "307c37c569b512f78358c2cf35f3f4a3fa305ac12b1ceff0b9960b9d4f18329d", "ja": "美希、お疲れさま！　ハラハラするくらいの、\nいいグラビアになりそうだな！", "zh": "美希，辛苦了！\n感觉能拍出甚至会让人紧张起来的写真照呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "c7edd52c3a4dbd46268ab1d627beaa44819f6d582ed5f80177180c71ee568707", "ja": "ホント？　なら大成功なの！　たくさんハラハラ\nドキドキしたあとは……次のステップね♪", "zh": "真的吗？那就表示非常成功！在提供许多紧张\n与心动的感觉后……就可以进入下一步了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2545f391c14da918ac2791d3b42752843511129d379a815725113de708957e0f", "ja": "ああ、次のステップ……の前に、\nまずは雪歩の撮影だな。", "zh": "嗯，不过在那之前……\n要先拍雪步的写真照呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "1bb821b08e7dcda500d81c50455d52f0ce2d786015719f8887c6b5d32a2d1613", "ja": "あ、そうそう！\n次は雪歩が、みんなをドキドキさせる番なの！", "zh": "啊，没错没错！\n接下来轮到雪步来让大家心跳加速了唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f9bb77754192ed5e5e5286d4e0a890bda4ee77e0b2c25f460999e737aafda4dd", "ja": "う、うん……。で、でも、\nやっぱり美希ちゃんみたいには……私……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……不、不过，\n我还是没办法……像美希那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "82e79f153d4982afa23774217dfc5db903ee86611012596e2f5566bdadc1e70f", "ja": "ねえ、雪歩。\n今って、もしかして……ドキドキしてる？", "zh": "雪步，美希问你喔。\n你现在是不是……心跳个不停？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "366e4b3e15d6bf8898b3b802f6ea11e24b7b24658899113a8a24f2ec6935c8cc", "ja": "う、うん。\nすごくドキドキしてる。", "zh": "对、对呀。\n我现在心跳得好快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "61bc1f30b6cf451000911043b48f07c2bf695342585779308a79ab6f0684326d", "ja": "あはっ、よかった。\nそれなら、ミキと一緒なの。", "zh": "啊哈，太好了。\n那就跟美希一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cff6e3a8a77eb930ad9768f04f7cd5efe4845187803d5a966776ac3e8ade42fe", "ja": "えっ……？　そ、そうなの？", "zh": "咦……？是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "2f8b1a10deed672467497e30b6ae7d692f9f512be037cbdf3c1894bcfd0b4256", "ja": "うん。ミキ、撮影はいつもドキドキしてるんだよ。\nこっち見てって。いっぱい見てって。", "zh": "嗯，美希在拍摄时心总是跳得很快喔。\n因为美希希望大家注意美希、多看看美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "234fb508abea85abc823b8982049ccf0a9be237e4ad362e5f195db4ede09ff33", "ja": "ミキのドキドキを、カメラに撮ってもらってるカンジ！\nミキのドキドキ、いっぱい感じてって♪", "zh": "就像是要让镜头把美希心跳不已的模样拍下来的感觉！\n要让大家尽情感受美希的心跳♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c5b2935fa428938ad1e6c4addcde7615e84a587e4d7945dbc235779110f6439f", "ja": "……聞いてるだけで、ドキドキしてきちゃった。\nやっぱり、美希ちゃんはすごいと思うなぁ……。", "zh": "……光是听着，就让我心跳加速起来了。\n美希果然非常厉害呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ed7d5d46e9d7dfc3283b8e17c3d0ef6f6f4b33e45379eddf090ad50bc3c46fcc", "ja": "見て、感じてって言えるのも……\n美希ちゃんが、美希ちゃんだからかも。", "zh": "或许正因为是美希……\n才有办法把「看着我」、「感受我」这些话说出口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2ee779583a60428b8eeb03d19e70a7ef5d540a13784e543208c49fed8d7c2445", "ja": "私は言えないの……。ごめんなさいってなっちゃう。\nだ、だからダメなんだよね。えへへ……。", "zh": "我说不出那种话……只会不由自主地想道歉。\n所、所以我才这么没出息吧，嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "a517a42e7b6567148b2b96b3ee340450c678241991b11b7720e3245eefcea84c", "ja": "ダメじゃないって思うな。\nドキドキしてごめんなさいって、撮ってもらったら？", "zh": "美希不觉得雪步没出息耶。\n就抱着「对不起，我心跳得好快」的心情去拍摄如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "e1f522d0f7f99742cc051e411eb1676f92922b1a632544d37898b8b9c8c06985", "ja": "そうだな。美希と同じようにドキドキしても、\n美希と同じようには、写らなくていいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是啊，就算你跟美希一样心跳个不停，\n也不需要拍出和她相同的效果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8bc5701e452febf3326d30c2ea856d3ba32833513ec14ca08a921466aa7154e1", "ja": "ドキドキしてる雪歩、そのまま撮ってもらわないか？\nただ踏みとどまって、顔を上げて。", "zh": "要不要就用雪步自己的心情去拍摄呢？\n只要你抬头挺胸，坚持到最后就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a6b72cbf25b55916739b2a4d03b10b7a5c784a0c498296fb736a5e170a919d54", "ja": "踏みとどまって、顔を上げて……。", "zh": "抬头挺胸，坚持到最后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "71857bf4093cd7dd243e470e4b81f72031653f33ee06007e0001445bfd9a167f", "ja": "雪歩って、わりといつもそんな感じだよね。\nだから、今回も大丈夫って思うな♪", "zh": "雪步平常差不多也都是这种感觉对吧？\n所以美希觉得这次一定也没问题的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1036_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7660cc97e05954a6fd8a0f13abacb51260bb4d5a983e6f460f7d12fd9e368915", "ja": "いつも……。うん、そうだね。\nいつも、私は……。", "zh": "平常……嗯，说得也是。\n我总是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1037_004yuk", "source_sha256": "140d159117d1531f8006328a03e39e5a9289c5fd9474cca795c8935ee62d5eb6", "ja": "美希ちゃん、ありがとう……。\n{$P$}も、ありがとうございますぅ。", "zh": "美希，谢谢你……\n也谢谢{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1038_003mik", "source_sha256": "568996ed3f18766f6af5a84cca7c90643293723113a92b7a3eb4983fdf785bc5", "ja": "……雪歩のドキドキ、撮ってもらえそう？", "zh": "……感觉能在镜头前表现出心跳加速的模样了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1039_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3088a7aa0e76dfe492846ee04826cb455244fab315f43679e69e9915169dd7ca", "ja": "うん。私、本当にいつもいっぱいいっぱいで……\nよたよたしてて、ダメダメだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，虽然我总是烦恼个不停、\n畏畏缩缩又不行不行的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1040_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a590bd57e551ba804ca90afcd7f52b8983dff03d65c02307ed81963ea6b37ddc", "ja": "でも、がんばって顔を上げたら……\nいつも、素敵な世界が見えてくるの。", "zh": "不过，每当我鼓起勇气抬起头……\n就能看见很棒的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1041_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c384c4985b83e456f9636e4d046eb41315482fedd7f20599a1d2e387fbb16941", "ja": "うん……。私、頑張るね。\n今のドキドキ、いっぱい撮ってもらうね！", "zh": "嗯……我会努力的。\n我会在镜头前展现出我心跳加速的模样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1042_003mik", "source_sha256": "082b3ea5a111f82816032054da9a731478307a6612ea8c044c94db85750ab627", "ja": "うん♪　あとで写真、見せあいっこしようね！", "zh": "嗯♪之后要跟美希交换照片看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1043_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "9ca6f29dc1b5cae30fc1251d9e8ca28743b5c3084383b338b3113fac44334550", "ja": "それじゃ、萩原さんの撮影、お願いしまーす！", "zh": "那么，麻烦萩原小姐准备上场拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1044_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d3a2a04ab78819aea61b10080ee10f18b1304bbfb31577a09f1afa8f95124d97", "ja": "はいっ！　美希ちゃん、{$P$}、\n行ってきます！", "zh": "好的！美希、{$P$}，\n我要上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1045_p", "source_sha256": "a7be5dceae497d5d2f09987b26a2854344aa1f26ea3b54351c1a6259b8453d84", "ja": "ああ、行ってこい、雪歩！", "zh": "嗯，去吧，雪步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1046_003mik", "source_sha256": "b1e8217614b14563de510fd257bf43e3398e4527123fb1483e7ea1d3f111ca47", "ja": "いってらっしゃい、なの☆", "zh": "慢走唷☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1047_p", "source_sha256": "a662a435e67915fb20a6dc384c008d3696726f5f3beace2feb14942402690c9a", "ja": "もう大丈夫そう……ん？", "zh": "看来她应该是没问题了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1049_p", "source_sha256": "da4c90135645e04df84e4e84ad9a65b84a25abe773ccad69f2665b3c22710681", "ja": "って、真と伊織じゃないか！？", "zh": "呃，真和伊织！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1050_006mak", "source_sha256": "f458e9a278f304a317eb244a93b465189672ca48a6c059cc8ad706797a107431", "ja": "わあっ、見つかった！", "zh": "哇啊，被发现了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1051_007ior", "source_sha256": "93b50617d3e357b0fbd2aa8502a5efb581a4fb452ea2db9f10e9e96506d9676c", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと、いきなり声かけないでよ！\nびっくりするじゃない！！", "zh": "等、等等，不要突然叫我啦！\n害我吓一大跳！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1052_p", "source_sha256": "546f6943a478e6b3fb17dc4bf04da42da327280e07fc0fd4547f7ab04f421442", "ja": "びっくりしたのはこっちだ！！", "zh": "我才吓一大跳好吗！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1053_p", "source_sha256": "3876ff04c6fd4efb773de8661ffcbc9faad947c7a9b7de6c684050562bacacdf", "ja": "で、二人ともダンスレッスン中のはずだけど……\nどうして見学に来てるんだ？", "zh": "你们两个不是应该在进行舞蹈训练吗……\n为什么跑来观摩了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1054_006mak", "source_sha256": "d3dc5d4a790af2f41e337fc6ba95ac2c245eec1fb23ae20134294ab6eda2612c", "ja": "い、いやあ、レッスンが早く終わったんですよ！\nそれで、せっかくだから～と思って……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛，因为训练提早结束了！\n我们想说机会难得，才会过来看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1055_007ior", "source_sha256": "a5db861f3fb2a2623ac3a35f709adb21845091252ceb2cfae0c24900a9cebe8c", "ja": "そ、そうそう、散歩のついでみたいなものよ♪\nここ、近所だもの。", "zh": "没、没错没错，我们只是散个步顺便过来而已♪\n毕竟距离又不远。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1056_p", "source_sha256": "b934e23b15b875ee9cbac106eed9690457e92b1a2fbc3bf09c5a0aee67f4774b", "ja": "……雪歩の撮影が気になって、レッスンに身が入らず、\n打ち切られたんじゃないだろうな？", "zh": "……你们该不会是太在意雪步的拍摄而无心训练，\n才导致训练中止吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1057_006mak", "source_sha256": "fb6819edfa7a741c8dfe5fb6577d80ccfd975012a82273a8ca7feb6cde14874c", "ja": "ぎくっ。", "zh": "呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1058_007ior", "source_sha256": "fb6819edfa7a741c8dfe5fb6577d80ccfd975012a82273a8ca7feb6cde14874c", "ja": "ぎくっ。", "zh": "呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1059_p", "source_sha256": "5e3ce4bece60e681454c76220372fea0cd300c086d80d74cfa42e8b1fe204f3b", "ja": "図星か……。", "zh": "我猜中了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1060_007ior", "source_sha256": "cc836e14af329e0007fd28c9ff3a4589c23ccf4e9eca9450ceca4c9d4f685636", "ja": "ま、真が悪いのよっ。ダンスは得意なくせに、\nあんなにたくさん間違えるから怒られたんじゃない！", "zh": "都、都是真不好啦，明明那么擅长跳舞，\n却犯了那么多错害我们被骂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1061_006mak", "source_sha256": "26040bdfb3251ace617123e7d2283f2caa1666f5b86aefcd71df5cdc70e5dcea", "ja": "うわ、くせにってなんだよ！？\n伊織なんか、根本的に覚えてなかったじゃないか！", "zh": "喂，「明明」是什么意思啊！？\n伊织你自己还不是连舞步都没记住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1062_003mik", "source_sha256": "8ef631af67f777f663f8f3ffa250b8d64ce943d3068e54350f09f45087e3264d", "ja": "もう、二人ともうるさいのーっ！\n雪歩の邪魔するなら、帰ってほしいって思うな！", "zh": "真是的，你们两个吵死了！如果你们是来\n打扰雪步的话，美希觉得你们还是回去比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1063_006mak", "source_sha256": "9c911bd14b3d5c12d1a09abcc91bf4517cd6e57f8dbecaefa20f32dd435996cf", "ja": "うわっ！　ご、ごめん……なさい……。", "zh": "唔哇！对、对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1064_007ior", "source_sha256": "73282b2aeae9a33292d7fedafd5aa48928a7f50fe31a704b6fec23bc483cc02f", "ja": "また、いいとこ持っていくんだから～っ。\nフーンだ！！", "zh": "你又把好处都占走～！\n哼！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1065_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f0e4ee8a92d3144dec438f3c7f8e2047a471bde233ccd23767ced40ee4fe2180", "ja": "あ、あの……わ、私の、ドキドキ……\n感じて、もらえますか……？", "zh": "那、那个……你、你有感受到……\n我的心跳吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1066_camman", "source_sha256": "80c92c8ce42aeadf56fc2e50a7f2de211c564c74baf79d43efa75719e0e097d5", "ja": "パシャパシャパシャパシャパシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1067_p", "source_sha256": "b50e9c46a5d5d0c029d96a617a2ebad2aa17638ee2e4c99d3ede3f17e1e1a9bb", "ja": "（喧騒をよそに、雪歩の撮影は順調に進んだ。\n雪歩らしい小悪魔が完成したかな）", "zh": "（不受场外的喧闹影响，雪步的拍摄进行得很顺利。\n有着雪步风格的小恶魔诞生了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_06_1068_p", "source_sha256": "f0d03baa9a1e117ffbd5c11812f7b22adf8bf8b70b3408106ccbff73070b5831", "ja": "（さあ、次はいよいよ、劇場でのお披露目だ！）", "zh": "（好，接下来终于要在剧场首次亮相了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
